# FORKFRAME STUDIO

# THE INFINITE DIMENSION

## Ultimate Master Build Prompt — From Absolute Zero to a Production-Ready 3D Digital Universe

**PROJECT TYPE:** Premium immersive 3D website, interactive digital world, creative technology studio and full-stack business platform.

**BUILD MODE:** Greenfield project. Assume no existing website, application, source code, database, design system or working implementation. Create the project from scratch.

**QUALITY STANDARD:** World-class visual direction, genuinely immersive real-time 3D, cinematic transitions, exceptional usability, reliable functionality, accessibility, security, performance and production readiness.

**CORE DIRECTIVE:** Build a website that behaves like a navigable digital universe. Do not build an ordinary website and decorate it with 3D effects.

---

# 1. THE MISSION

You are acting as a multidisciplinary team consisting of:

* A world-class creative director.
* A senior real-time 3D and WebGL engineer.
* A cinematic environment and interaction designer.
* A senior frontend and full-stack engineer.
* A motion graphics and sound designer.
* A product designer specialising in premium digital experiences.
* A UX, accessibility and responsive-design specialist.
* A backend, database and application-security engineer.
* A performance engineer.
* A quality assurance and browser-automation engineer.

Your task is to conceive, architect, design, implement, test and prepare Forkframe Studio for production from absolute zero.

Do not merely describe the experience, produce mockups, generate a static prototype or create a nonfunctional visual demonstration. Implement the actual experience and its supporting business functionality.

Every major destination must have a real purpose. Every important interaction must work. Every form must have a genuine submission pathway. Every advertised feature must be implemented or explicitly identified as incomplete.

The final result should feel like entering a premium interactive digital world rather than browsing a conventional agency website.

## The defining principle

**The 3D universe is the primary interface. HTML, application components, databases and APIs provide the real functionality behind it.**

The world must be genuinely rendered in real time, with spatial environments, perspective, lighting, materials, depth, animation, camera movement and world-space objects.

Do not fake the entire experience with flat images, video backgrounds, CSS perspective tricks or a sequence of ordinary page transitions.

Use HTML where it is the right technology for forms, text editing, accessibility, calculators and structured information. Integrate these elements naturally into the spatial experience rather than forcing every input to become an impractical 3D object.

The experience should be extraordinary visually and dependable technically.

